    11275   with FRAME BottomFrame width 232 PAGE-BOTTOM NO-LABELS NO-BOX .
    11276   VIEW  STREAM PrnLibStream FRAME BottomFrame .
    11277   FORM with FRAME dis-rule-list  .
    11278   run waitfram-show in this-procedure ( input "Ждите...").
    11279   v-doc-rec = recid(X_dis-rule).
    11280   DO WHILE available X_dis-rule :
